r2065 (bm-c): a reader must not crash on a state its writer may publish.

Two legs the r2061 triage called EXCEPTION died on the same silent upstream
the r2062..r2064 root-cause pass traced (cut receipt UNREADABLE -> no gap_k):
  etf_book_permission_persistence --check  -> KeyError: 'gap_k'
  etf_book_cash_roll_today --selftest      -> KeyError: 'cash_cny'  (a
selftest reading the LIVE faces, i.e. the market deciding whether its own
test passes). The checker now says UPSTREAM_SILENT and exits 3 (the harness
closes it UNVERIFIED, r1861/r1943); the selftest is fixture-only.

